1
00:01:31,690 --> 00:01:34,950
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:37,840
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:38,789 --> 00:01:40,120
It's showtime

4
00:01:40,150 --> 00:01:41,789
for our Cover-Up Alliance.

5
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,640
What trick are you going to play?

6
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:57,310
What have your dad and I been

7
00:01:57,310 --> 00:01:58,840
hoping for all these years?

8
00:01:59,000 --> 00:01:59,430
It's for you

9
00:01:59,430 --> 00:02:00,870
to be selected for the national team

10
00:02:00,870 --> 00:02:02,310
and bring honor to our family.

11
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:03,170
But look at you,

12
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,130
sneakily dating...

13
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,450
dating her

14
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,039
r-right under our noses.

15
00:02:08,090 --> 00:02:08,750
Don't you realize

16
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:09,710
how hard it is for a family

17
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:11,370
like ours to raise an athlete?

18
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,720
Are you trying to give me a heart attack?

19
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,550
Enough.

20
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:17,030
You've been nagging all night.

21
00:02:17,030 --> 00:02:18,090
Let's just go back.

22
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:21,079
The kid is still doing homework. Let's go.

23
00:02:21,090 --> 00:02:22,090
Coach Ma said

24
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,710
he's at a critical stage right now

25
00:02:23,710 --> 00:02:25,310
and must focus entirely on training.

26
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:26,710
Alright, let's go.

27
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,120
They have to break up!

28
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,300
Cao Si wants you to meet her

29
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,680
at the bus station at 7 AM tomorrow.

30
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,700
She's pretty determined.

31
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:44,340
Don't disappoint her.

32
00:02:45,130 --> 00:02:46,860
What kind of person do you think I am?

33
00:02:46,860 --> 00:02:47,520
Do you think I am

34
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,320
that kind of irresponsible man?

35
00:02:50,079 --> 00:02:51,280
I will definitely go.

36
00:02:51,870 --> 00:02:52,430
I love her

37
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,770
just as much as she loves me.

38
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,520
Fine,

39
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,610
then I can rest assured.

40
00:03:16,329 --> 00:03:17,680
Si, come over here.

41
00:03:24,870 --> 00:03:25,430
Si,

42
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:27,200
your priority right now

43
00:03:28,079 --> 00:03:29,960
is to work hard to improve yourself

44
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,840
and get a better education.

45
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,320
You're only 21

46
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:36,090
and have plenty of time ahead.

47
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,810
As for dating and marriage,

48
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,079
don't force it.

49
00:03:40,470 --> 00:03:41,800
I'm speaking from experience.

50
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,150
Just listen to me.

51
00:03:45,150 --> 00:03:45,680
Let's go.

52
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,190
Dad, Dad.

53
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,800
Let me send my sister off.

54
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:56,280
No need. Let me do it.

55
00:03:56,710 --> 00:03:58,310
You stay home and study.

56
00:03:58,910 --> 00:04:00,680
Don't let anything distract you

57
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,870
from your studies,

58
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:02,520
okay?

59
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,200
Come on, Si. Let's go.

60
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:08,190
Si!

61
00:04:32,190 --> 00:04:33,320
Where are you going?

62
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,040
Mom,

63
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,070
Si is going to Jiangping today.

64
00:04:37,070 --> 00:04:38,000
I'm going to see her off.

65
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,820
Cao Si just left,

66
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:40,270
and you're following her out?

67
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:41,000
You can't go.

68
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:43,680
Mom, I have to

69
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,270
see this through.

70
00:04:44,270 --> 00:04:45,240
I shall be responsible for her.

71
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,090
"See this through"? What do you mean?

72
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:47,120
What are you responsible for?

73
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,510
You two are nowhere near that stage.

74
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,000
Sorry, Mom,

75
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,600
no matter what you say,

76
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,240
I have to go today.

77
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,720
You're not going. Go back inside!

78
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,120
Mom!

79
00:04:52,270 --> 00:04:53,680
You're not listening to me, are you?

80
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,420
Get inside!

81
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,680
Mom, Mom, Mom!
I'm just going to see her off.

82
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,830
I can't do anything else.

83
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:00,760
Why did you even lock the door, Mom?

84
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:01,950
No, Mom...

85
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,010
What are you doing?

86
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:03,530
Listen,

87
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:04,480
if you walk out the door today,

88
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,680
you're no longer my son.

89
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,600
I am your son!

90
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,190
How does seeing her off

91
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,070
make me not your son?

92
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:08,670
Why are you

93
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,510
seeing her off? Why?

94
00:05:09,510 --> 00:05:10,310
Who do you think you are?

95
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,070
I'm nobody.

96
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:11,750
But I ought to see her off

97
00:05:11,750 --> 00:05:12,510
as we've been friends for years,

98
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:12,830
right?

99
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:13,870
No, you're not going out.

100
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:14,270
Qi Shi!

101
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,600
Pass on a message to Si for me.

102
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,480
Tell her to wait for me!

103
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,390
I won't give up!

104
00:05:17,630 --> 00:05:18,070
Qi Shi!

105
00:06:02,270 --> 00:06:03,240
Cao Si!

106
00:06:03,870 --> 00:06:04,830
Cao Si!

107
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:06,270
Cao Si!

108
00:06:06,430 --> 00:06:06,870
Qi Shi!

109
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,240
My brother wants you to wait for him!

110
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,510
He won't give up!

111
00:06:09,870 --> 00:06:11,120
He said he won't give up,

112
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:11,950
Cao Si!

113
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:12,960
Your face!

114
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,870
My brother wants you to wait for him!

115
00:06:14,870 --> 00:06:17,400
Remember to ride in the shade
on your way back!

116
00:06:18,750 --> 00:06:19,950
Be safe!

117
00:06:50,390 --> 00:06:50,870
Qi Shi,

118
00:06:50,890 --> 00:06:52,490
how did you get so sunburned?

119
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:54,550
How did it go?

120
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:57,710
Oh, my God, your face.

121
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,000
I am so sorry.

122
00:07:00,390 --> 00:07:01,160
I will do

123
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:02,920
whatever you say for the next week.

124
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,600
I'm fine.

125
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,720
What matters now is that you

126
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,630
should figure out

127
00:07:06,630 --> 00:07:07,800
how to get Mom to agree

128
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,310
to your relationship.

129
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:10,830
At this point,

130
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:12,000
what else can I do?

131
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,000
I'll just have to do it the hard way.

132
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,880
As the saying goes,

133
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:15,690
persistence

134
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,630
pays off.

135
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,120
I'll just keep pestering her

136
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,120
until she agrees.

137
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,920
Good luck.

138
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,720
Given your track record against Mom,

139
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,120
I don't think you stand much of a chance.

140
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,340
Alright, no more talking. Let's go get

141
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:28,400
meds for your face.

142
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,190
Coach Ma, please rest assured.

143
00:07:33,190 --> 00:07:33,850
His dad and I

144
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:35,070
absolutely won't allow him

145
00:07:35,070 --> 00:07:36,400
to date anyone anymore.

146
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,240
He definitely won't

147
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,870
leave without permission again.

148
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:40,070
We just have to trouble you

149
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:41,510
to watch him closely

150
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,120
and push him to train hard recently.

151
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:46,159
Just like you, we really hope

152
00:07:46,159 --> 00:07:47,310
Qi Zhi can get good results.

153
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:48,390
How did Mom act so fast?

154
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,720
She even got to my coach!

155
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:52,560
Weren't you just gearing up passionately?

156
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,390
You're not going

157
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:54,950
to surrender to Mom later, are you?

158
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:56,150
Who's surrendering?

159
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,720
I'm always

160
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,320
one step ahead of her!

161
00:08:00,950 --> 00:08:02,550
Alright, go apply ointment.

162
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,370
Let's go, let's go.

163
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,250
What's going on?

164
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,380
Where's the phone?

165
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,080
The coach said that

166
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,520
to let you focus on training,

167
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:54,670
he decided to temporarily disconnect

168
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:55,600
your phone line.

169
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,780
One rapeseed oil, please.

170
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,240
Okay.

171
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,240
A-And a pack of tissues.

172
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,630
How much in total?

173
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:06,490
Thirteen yuan.

174
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:14,870
Seriously?

175
00:10:15,510 --> 00:10:16,750
It's just a made-up story,

176
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:17,810
and you're crying?

177
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:25,870
It just reminded me

178
00:10:25,870 --> 00:10:27,510
of my brother and your sister,

179
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:29,040
and I couldn't hold it back.

180
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,670
My dad is really

181
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:35,200
determined to split them up

182
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,360
for good this time.

183
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,390
You know, in TV dramas,

184
00:10:40,670 --> 00:10:42,320
no matter how much parents disapprove

185
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,650
or how tough things get,

186
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:46,480
the protagonists always end up together.

187
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,260
But why is it so hard for people

188
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,440
to be together in real life?

189
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,450
I told you,

190
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,320
TV dramas are all made up.

191
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,000
They shouldn't make it up like that.

192
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,720
Isn't that basically lying?

193
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:18,120
I've kept this for over 10 years

194
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,320
without drinking it.

195
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,510
You lucky dog.

196
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,840
Man, look at you.

197
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,260
Are you craving a drink again?

198
00:11:27,670 --> 00:11:29,200
What do you mean?

199
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:31,870
Am I that kind of unreliable person?

200
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,910
It's about

201
00:11:34,150 --> 00:11:36,080
the thousands of latex gloves we sold

202
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:38,010
to the beauty school a few days ago.

203
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,070
The middleman's been such a big help.

204
00:11:40,070 --> 00:11:41,030
We should return the favor

205
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:41,790
to him.

206
00:11:42,790 --> 00:11:43,520
That's true.

207
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:45,520
We earned a lot from that deal.

208
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,200
I heard from their principal,
Principal Wang,

209
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,240
that they'll purchase that much

210
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,700
every quarter from now on.

211
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:55,030
You're finally being reliable for once.

212
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:55,960
I am reliable, right?

213
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,090
Who do you think I am?

214
00:11:57,790 --> 00:11:59,190
So who is that middleman?

215
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,920
You wouldn't know him even if I told you.

216
00:12:04,750 --> 00:12:05,240
Honey,

217
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,640
when I give discounts

218
00:12:07,670 --> 00:12:09,200
or let people buy on credit,

219
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,480
isn't that all about

220
00:12:10,510 --> 00:12:11,840
building connections?

221
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:14,870
I've got a lot of connections
ever since I started

222
00:12:14,870 --> 00:12:16,330
doing business out there.

223
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,760
If you have a lot of connections,

224
00:12:20,770 --> 00:12:21,810
then pigs

225
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,440
can fly.

226
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:25,790
Come on, enough.

227
00:12:25,790 --> 00:12:27,240
Stop trying to be so generous.

228
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,820
We don't have much to spare and can't

229
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:30,390
afford you wasting it like this.

230
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:31,240
No, honey.

231
00:12:31,790 --> 00:12:33,790
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

232
00:12:33,910 --> 00:12:35,270
He did us such a huge favor!

233
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:36,070
We have to show

234
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,480
our appreciation.

235
00:12:37,870 --> 00:12:38,830
Liquor should be given in pairs.

236
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:39,200
How

237
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:41,480
can we just give one bottle?

238
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,870
Think carefully about it.

239
00:12:42,870 --> 00:12:44,960
Is the profit
of those 5,000 pairs of gloves

240
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,910
really worth the price
of these two bottles of liquor?

241
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:48,570
These are fine, aged liquors.

242
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:51,240
Alright, just give one bottle.

243
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,510
Fine.

244
00:12:57,570 --> 00:12:59,360
Look at the mess you made here.

245
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:07,370
You think I don't know
what you're capable of?

246
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,360
This place is nice. It's quiet here.

247
00:13:47,390 --> 00:13:48,760
So no one will see us

248
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:49,970
or misunderstand.

249
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,150
That beauty school's deal

250
00:13:56,150 --> 00:13:57,360
you referred me to last time

251
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,670
went through.

252
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,370
Here's your cut.

253
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,940
I didn't refer you to the business

254
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:04,760
for a share of profit in return.

255
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:07,630
Come on, man,

256
00:14:08,150 --> 00:14:09,440
just take what I offer.

257
00:14:10,150 --> 00:14:10,630
No need.

258
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,320
You might not be doing it for the money,

259
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,670
but I can't be ungrateful.

260
00:14:14,670 --> 00:14:16,060
Let's not do this between us.

261
00:14:16,060 --> 00:14:17,150
I'm telling you to take it, so just

262
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:18,610
listen to me and accept it.

263
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,330
I mean,

264
00:14:23,390 --> 00:14:24,450
since our families

265
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:26,150
have fallen out with each other,

266
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:27,350
we need to act like it.

267
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,200
So you must accept this gift.

268
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:31,260
I don't want to owe you favors.

269
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:34,630
As I said before,

270
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:35,900
from now on,

271
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:37,720
we will

272
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:40,480
go our separate ways.

273
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,390
Come with me.

274
00:14:48,630 --> 00:14:49,150
What?

275
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:50,630
Come here.

276
00:14:50,990 --> 00:14:51,510
What's up?

277
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:52,170
Put it away.

278
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:53,820
Well...

279
00:14:54,910 --> 00:14:56,370
It's rush hour with people

280
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:57,200
everywhere.

281
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,050
Don't let anyone see it.

282
00:15:03,070 --> 00:15:04,130
Looks like we can't

283
00:15:04,150 --> 00:15:05,600
go our separate ways.

284
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:10,780
Cao Xin, you got out of school?

285
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:49,030
Cao Xin.

286
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:52,360
Grandpa and I are going to attend
a wedding.

287
00:15:52,670 --> 00:15:54,530
We'll probably have a few drinks.

288
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:56,080
Not sure when we'll be back.

289
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,280
The food is in the pot.

290
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:57,790
Got it.

291
00:15:59,150 --> 00:16:00,670
We're running a bit low on soap.

292
00:16:00,670 --> 00:16:01,870
We need to order more.

293
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:07,630
Qi Shi.

294
00:16:08,790 --> 00:16:09,320
Qi Shi.

295
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,770
We still owe Mrs. Ma a bag

296
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:14,910
of washing powder from yesterday.

297
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:16,040
Go deliver it to her.

298
00:16:16,540 --> 00:16:17,480
I'm doing my homework.

299
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:18,840
Can I deliver it this afternoon?

300
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:19,810
Kiddo,

301
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,840
you should take a walk after eating.

302
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:22,940
Come on, get up.

303
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,440
Show some energy.

304
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:25,530
Hurry up.

305
00:16:45,030 --> 00:16:46,230
Be careful, it's hot.

306
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:48,020
Marinated leaf mustard filling,

307
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:48,880
your favorite.

308
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,810
Your dad's gone too far.

309
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:53,790
How could he starve

310
00:16:53,790 --> 00:16:55,520
his child just for a poor grade?

311
00:16:56,510 --> 00:16:58,080
I already couldn't stand it yesterday.

312
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:58,750
Exactly.

313
00:16:58,870 --> 00:17:00,510
Why is your dad so strict?

314
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:02,080
You only got a few questions wrong.

315
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:02,870
Yeah.

316
00:17:03,270 --> 00:17:03,960
If he did it,

317
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,270
could he get them all right?

318
00:17:05,270 --> 00:17:06,030
What a man.

319
00:17:06,569 --> 00:17:07,849
Easier said than done.

320
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:10,369
Take your time.

321
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,099
Come on.

322
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:11,660
Come on.

323
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:13,550
Don't just eat the buns.

324
00:17:13,550 --> 00:17:14,680
Have some porridge.

325
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,000
It's hot. Be careful.

326
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:22,349
Take your time.

327
00:17:22,349 --> 00:17:24,400
Take two more with you when you go back.

328
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:26,130
Eat secretly if you get hungry.

329
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,970
Don't let your dad find out.

330
00:17:30,310 --> 00:17:31,170
Hi, Mrs. Zhang.

331
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:32,390
Hi, Qi Shi.

332
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,110
The sun's really strong.

333
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:34,200
Why did you come out instead of

334
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:35,000
staying home?

335
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:35,550
Well,

336
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:37,750
I went to help my mom deliver something.

337
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:38,350
Potatoes.

338
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:39,820
Here, have one.

339
00:17:44,110 --> 00:17:44,770
Come on, go.

340
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:45,620
Get out.

341
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,240
Go, quickly.

342
00:17:47,750 --> 00:17:49,070
No, no, don't go that way.

343
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:49,680
Climb over the wall.

344
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:50,350
Don't go that way.

345
00:17:50,350 --> 00:17:51,150
Over the wall.

346
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:52,200
Wait, hold on!

347
00:17:54,110 --> 00:17:55,640
Hurry! T-Take two more.

348
00:17:55,750 --> 00:17:56,480
Take two more buns.

349
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,070
Here you are.

350
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:57,680
I've got enough.

351
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,030
G-Get a plastic bag and pack some more.

352
00:17:59,030 --> 00:17:59,890
Pack some more.

353
00:18:01,790 --> 00:18:02,240
Wait.

354
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:04,450
Catch it.

355
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:11,130
You're back.

356
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:15,520
Didn't we just have breakfast?

357
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,120
Your dad is hungry again.

358
00:18:18,270 --> 00:18:19,270
Yeah, I'm hungry.

359
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:24,040
How come you're back so soon?

360
00:18:24,550 --> 00:18:25,610
I ran into Tianji.

361
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,350
He was on the way,

362
00:18:26,350 --> 00:18:27,610
so I had him drop it off.

363
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,530
You're eating so many buns?

364
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,040
I'm starving.

365
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:41,690
You came to my house for some buns.

366
00:18:41,830 --> 00:18:43,550
Why did they make it so sneaky?

367
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:46,000
And they didn't even let me know?

368
00:18:46,070 --> 00:18:46,890
Honestly,

369
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:49,210
your parents are so good to me.

370
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:51,380
Better than your dad is to you?

371
00:18:52,310 --> 00:18:52,720
No,

372
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:55,920
it's different from
how my dad treats me

373
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:56,680
well.

374
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:59,110
Your mom passed away early.

375
00:18:59,590 --> 00:19:00,200
My mom's

376
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:02,350
always said she'd be a mother to everyone.

377
00:19:02,350 --> 00:19:04,610
That's probably why she's so good to you.

378
00:19:04,710 --> 00:19:05,460
But if

379
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:07,480
they're so good to you,

380
00:19:08,600 --> 00:19:10,720
why don't they get along with your dad?

381
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,720
Probably some historical baggage.

382
00:19:16,110 --> 00:19:17,440
I can't believe your dad

383
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:18,720
didn't let you eat just

384
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:20,250
because of a bad math score.

385
00:19:21,790 --> 00:19:23,590
Your mom's buns are really good.

386
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:31,240
Bye.

387
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:38,440
Cao Xin,

388
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,240
look at your math score.

389
00:19:40,510 --> 00:19:41,750
Compared to Qi Shi,

390
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:42,750
you're at least

391
00:19:42,750 --> 00:19:43,880
10 galaxies behind.

392
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,240
How about

393
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:46,830
you learn from Qi Shi?

394
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,420
There's no shame in bowing

395
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:50,350
to a girl.

396
00:19:51,310 --> 00:19:51,830
Qi Shi,

397
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,130
hurry up.

398
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:57,110
Come on, we're running late.

399
00:19:57,510 --> 00:19:58,880
Meet me at the sausage stall.

400
00:19:58,880 --> 00:19:59,440
Sausage?

401
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:00,460
Let's go...

402
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,340
Count me in.

403
00:20:17,110 --> 00:20:18,480
I've got something urgent tonight.

404
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,680
Could you do it for me?

405
00:20:19,830 --> 00:20:20,350
Please.

406
00:20:23,010 --> 00:20:23,640
Aren't you exempt

407
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,700
from math homework, exceptionally?

408
00:20:26,390 --> 00:20:27,760
My mom assigned it.

409
00:20:27,790 --> 00:20:28,790
I don't have time.

410
00:20:29,110 --> 00:20:29,960
Your dad loves seeing you

411
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:31,070
do homework, right?

412
00:20:31,070 --> 00:20:32,670
D-Does it matter whose it is?

413
00:20:32,750 --> 00:20:34,280
Wait, why should I help you?

414
00:20:34,790 --> 00:20:35,120
Well,

415
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,140
we're partners in a cover-up.

416
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:38,080
Shouldn't we

417
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:39,070
help each other?

418
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:40,310
Besides, I helped you do it

419
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:41,440
when we were little.

420
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,280
Ever heard of returning a favor?

421
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:46,740
Who's your partner in a cover-up?

422
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:30,030
Dongfang.

423
00:21:32,070 --> 00:21:33,200
He's been doing it all night.

424
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,330
Give the kid a break.

425
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:36,120
He's studying right now.

426
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:38,080
Math is his weak subject.

427
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,890
He should focus on studying it.

428
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:42,240
Weak subject or not, he's just a kid.

429
00:21:42,270 --> 00:21:43,530
What's a kid's nature?

430
00:21:44,520 --> 00:21:45,080
He should

431
00:21:45,110 --> 00:21:46,640
go out and have fun.

432
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:47,680
When you were little,

433
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:49,310
you climbed trees for birds
and went into rivers for fish.

434
00:21:49,310 --> 00:21:50,110
Have you forgotten?

435
00:21:50,110 --> 00:21:50,910
Alright, Dad.

436
00:21:51,110 --> 00:21:52,270
Times have changed.

437
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:53,720
Do you know how much pressure

438
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:54,780
there is nowadays?

439
00:21:55,030 --> 00:21:55,550
Had I

440
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:57,200
just worked a little harder back then,

441
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,920
I wouldn't have ended up
at just a junior college.

442
00:21:58,920 --> 00:21:59,680
Oh, my God.

443
00:22:00,790 --> 00:22:02,120
You mean I held you back?

444
00:22:03,070 --> 00:22:04,070
I didn't say that.

445
00:22:04,310 --> 00:22:05,330
Then listen to me

446
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:06,040
this time.

447
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:07,150
Xin.

448
00:22:09,310 --> 00:22:10,040
My legs hurt.

449
00:22:10,070 --> 00:22:11,200
Go buy some liquor for me.

450
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:12,240
You can also get some fresh air.

451
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:12,510
Go.

452
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:13,200
Okay.

453
00:22:32,790 --> 00:22:33,440
Your "urgent" matter

454
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:34,700
is watching a TV drama?

455
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:37,670
Isn't it urgent?

456
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,010
At 8 sharp every day.
No waiting for anyone.

457
00:22:40,010 --> 00:22:41,720
The thing is, our TV is malfunctioning.

458
00:22:41,720 --> 00:22:43,310
My dad hasn't had time to fix it yet.

459
00:22:43,310 --> 00:22:44,910
I can only come here to watch.

460
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:46,220
You're unbelievable.

461
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:47,310
Junior year is easy.

462
00:22:47,310 --> 00:22:48,000
I won't have time

463
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:49,330
to watch in senior year.

464
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,750
I could be playing games

465
00:22:50,750 --> 00:22:51,440
instead of doing

466
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,270
your homework.

467
00:22:52,270 --> 00:22:54,000
-Don't be mad.
-Do it yourself!

468
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,480
No, come on...

469
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:57,730
You still have to help me do it today.

470
00:22:57,730 --> 00:22:58,790
You can't break your promise,

471
00:22:58,790 --> 00:22:59,270
Cao Xin.

472
00:23:07,750 --> 00:23:08,550
I admit it.

473
00:23:09,240 --> 00:23:10,130
I lied when I said I had

474
00:23:10,130 --> 00:23:11,200
something urgent and asked you

475
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,530
to do my homework for me.

476
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:13,510
I'm sorry.

477
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:15,460
I apologize to you.

478
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:17,200
But that was because

479
00:23:17,310 --> 00:23:19,350
the protagonists in the drama
finally got together.

480
00:23:19,350 --> 00:23:19,790
Wasn't that

481
00:23:19,790 --> 00:23:21,310
something super important?

482
00:23:21,310 --> 00:23:22,350
I definitely wanted to see

483
00:23:22,350 --> 00:23:23,550
the scene right away.

484
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:24,200
See?

485
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:25,480
If you think about it,

486
00:23:25,480 --> 00:23:26,160
I actually

487
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:27,360
wasn't lying, right?

488
00:23:27,510 --> 00:23:28,070
Besides,

489
00:23:28,310 --> 00:23:30,110
you also got a chance

490
00:23:30,390 --> 00:23:31,240
to review

491
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,670
your weak spots in Unit 2.

492
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,440
That was not

493
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:34,900
a bad thing for you, right?

494
00:23:35,070 --> 00:23:35,720
Maybe

495
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:36,350
your math score

496
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:37,680
will even improve a lot.

497
00:23:38,030 --> 00:23:39,490
You should be thanking me.

498
00:23:39,550 --> 00:23:40,510
So I think...

499
00:23:40,750 --> 00:23:41,070
You

500
00:23:41,070 --> 00:23:42,920
can totally just see it

501
00:23:43,070 --> 00:23:45,640
as me doing this for your own good.

502
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:47,110
You can't turn around

503
00:23:47,110 --> 00:23:47,970
and be mad at me.

504
00:23:56,640 --> 00:23:57,700
What are you doing?

505
00:23:57,960 --> 00:23:58,420
What...

506
00:23:58,550 --> 00:23:59,270
What's this?

507
00:23:59,270 --> 00:23:59,730
Well...

508
00:24:00,550 --> 00:24:02,070
I'm talking to you,
yet you're listening to this?

509
00:24:02,070 --> 00:24:02,730
Don't pull.

510
00:24:02,790 --> 00:24:03,640
-Be gentle.
-Let me see.

511
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,510
It'll break.

512
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:05,830
Is this new?

513
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:07,880
Class is starting.

514
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,240
The teacher is here. Go inside.

515
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,270
L-Let go.

516
00:24:12,710 --> 00:24:13,840
Get ready for class.

517
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:14,410
Stand up.

518
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:16,720
Hello, class.

519
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:19,960
-Hello, sir.
-Hello, sir.

520
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,370
You may sit down.

521
00:24:23,030 --> 00:24:24,030
Just a quick word.

522
00:24:24,590 --> 00:24:26,270
The monthly exam results are out.

523
00:24:26,270 --> 00:24:27,720
Everyone has made progress.

524
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:28,240
But

525
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,070
someone in our class made

526
00:24:30,070 --> 00:24:31,350
dramatic improvement,

527
00:24:31,350 --> 00:24:32,150
with the score

528
00:24:32,270 --> 00:24:33,720
soaring by over 10 points.

529
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:35,550
-Who is it?
-Who is it?

530
00:24:37,830 --> 00:24:38,590
Cao Xin,

531
00:24:39,590 --> 00:24:40,510
138.

532
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,210
This should be

533
00:24:45,510 --> 00:24:47,270
his highest score ever.

534
00:24:48,070 --> 00:24:49,480
And this time, he even got

535
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:50,640
a perfect score

536
00:24:51,110 --> 00:24:52,400
on his weakest unit.

537
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:53,240
Now,

538
00:24:53,510 --> 00:24:55,030
let's give a warm round of applause

539
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:56,430
to congratulate Cao Xin.

540
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:01,600
Well done!

541
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,400
Thank you, sir.

542
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:03,000
Keep it up.

543
00:25:06,030 --> 00:25:06,750
Tian Zihao,

544
00:25:07,350 --> 00:25:08,000
95.

545
00:25:09,510 --> 00:25:10,170
How's that?

546
00:25:10,590 --> 00:25:11,720
Shouldn't you thank me?

547
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,780
Thank you for what?

548
00:25:12,830 --> 00:25:13,680
Wu Wenbo,

549
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:15,000
103.

550
00:25:17,790 --> 00:25:19,190
I have high hopes for you.

551
00:25:57,830 --> 00:26:01,080
♪ How I wish
I could go back to that summer ♪

552
00:26:01,270 --> 00:26:04,760
♪ With cicadas humming and wind
blowing past my eyes by the field ♪

553
00:26:04,780 --> 00:26:08,310
♪ Enchanted by the starry summer night
and your face ♪

554
00:26:08,330 --> 00:26:11,870
♪ I still remember the breeze
that stirred my heart ♪

555
00:26:11,890 --> 00:26:15,060
♪ The early summer
tastes like your smile ♪

556
00:26:15,370 --> 00:26:19,560
♪ I hold the moon wish you well ♪

557
00:26:19,580 --> 00:26:21,810
♪ Go further ♪

558
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:25,310
♪ For a brighter day ♪

559
00:26:27,500 --> 00:26:30,560
♪ The young man in white shirt ♪

560
00:26:30,580 --> 00:26:33,310
♪ He's in the class next door ♪

561
00:26:34,580 --> 00:26:37,520
♪ Sweating on the playground ♪

562
00:26:37,540 --> 00:26:40,350
♪ He's playing basketball so well ♪

563
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:43,560
♪ My longing for you
is all over the place ♪

564
00:26:44,290 --> 00:26:46,440
♪ My heart races fast for you ♪

565
00:26:46,510 --> 00:26:47,480
Not bad, Cao Xin.

566
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:48,640
Good job.

567
00:26:49,720 --> 00:26:51,250
You've made huge progress.

568
00:26:52,590 --> 00:26:53,200
Tell me

569
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:55,080
what reward you want.

570
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,500
I'll buy you anything.

571
00:27:00,550 --> 00:27:01,000
Dad,

572
00:27:02,590 --> 00:27:04,240
I want a computer in my room.

573
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,250
A computer?

574
00:27:12,550 --> 00:27:13,000
Okay,

575
00:27:14,030 --> 00:27:14,720
you got it.

576
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:16,450
Thanks, Dad.

577
00:27:19,030 --> 00:27:19,690
Study hard.

578
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:24,350
Okay.

579
00:27:25,110 --> 00:27:25,680
Thanks.

580
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:27,200
Don't mention it.

581
00:27:27,640 --> 00:27:28,170
Cao Xin.

582
00:27:28,830 --> 00:27:29,920
Having a computer will make

583
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:31,110
studying much easier.

584
00:27:31,110 --> 00:27:32,040
I almost forgot.

585
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,240
I had a friend

586
00:27:34,510 --> 00:27:36,310
copy some college entrance exam

587
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:37,930
question banks.

588
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:38,310
Here.

589
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:40,030
It'll be much more convenient

590
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:41,490
to do them on the computer.

591
00:27:41,590 --> 00:27:42,050
I got it.

592
00:27:42,510 --> 00:27:43,000
Zihao,

593
00:27:43,740 --> 00:27:44,600
teach him more.

594
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:45,480
Yes, sure.

595
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:46,370
I got it, sir.

596
00:27:49,920 --> 00:27:51,240
Your dad is horrible.

597
00:27:51,550 --> 00:27:53,010
He bought a computer to...

598
00:27:53,110 --> 00:27:54,310
Everyone uses it for gaming,

599
00:27:54,310 --> 00:27:55,110
but yours became

600
00:27:55,110 --> 00:27:56,040
a study machine.

601
00:27:56,110 --> 00:27:56,890
Computers were

602
00:27:56,890 --> 00:27:57,520
invented

603
00:27:57,550 --> 00:27:59,000
to facilitate calculations.

604
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:01,130
It's only right to use it for studying.

605
00:28:02,830 --> 00:28:04,160
But it doesn't stop us from gaming,

606
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:04,560
right?

607
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:05,690
Exactly.

608
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:06,400
It has

609
00:28:06,790 --> 00:28:08,450
the latest and hottest games.

610
00:28:08,550 --> 00:28:09,680
I tried them. They're fun.

611
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:10,800
I'm sure you'll find one you like.

612
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:11,960
You're a true friend.

613
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:13,560
How do I install these games?

614
00:28:17,110 --> 00:28:17,570
Well...

615
00:28:18,270 --> 00:28:18,960
Um...

616
00:28:21,180 --> 00:28:22,040
Call me master.

617
00:28:22,570 --> 00:28:23,160
No.

618
00:28:25,570 --> 00:28:27,300
You want to end our friendship?

619
00:28:27,910 --> 00:28:28,540
Okay.

620
00:28:33,550 --> 00:28:34,350
Fine, fine...

621
00:28:35,030 --> 00:28:35,760
Twenty yuan,

622
00:28:36,550 --> 00:28:38,480
and I will help you win first place.

623
00:28:40,490 --> 00:28:41,220
I'm leaving.

624
00:28:41,300 --> 00:28:42,350
Come back here. Come back.

625
00:28:42,350 --> 00:28:43,480
What? You regret it?

626
00:28:44,830 --> 00:28:45,240
Well,

627
00:28:46,070 --> 00:28:47,330
do you know how to watch TV dramas

628
00:28:47,330 --> 00:28:48,260
on the computer?

629
00:29:11,790 --> 00:29:12,680
What?

630
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:15,660
Did you ask me
to take binoculars to the yard

631
00:29:15,660 --> 00:29:16,640
to watch you do homework?

632
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:17,240
Or are you trying to

633
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:18,570
show off your computer?

634
00:30:14,510 --> 00:30:17,030
I still feel so bad
for the second female lead.

635
00:30:17,030 --> 00:30:19,480
She's pretty, she's got nice personality,
and she's from a good family,

636
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,750
yet the male lead is still not into her.

637
00:30:20,750 --> 00:30:21,750
I know, right?

638
00:30:21,960 --> 00:30:23,620
But the female lead is so cute.

639
00:30:26,030 --> 00:30:27,230
Why are you laughing?

640
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:28,510
This is true love,

641
00:30:28,510 --> 00:30:28,880
you know?

642
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:30,290
After the final episode tomorrow,

643
00:30:30,290 --> 00:30:32,890
you'd better
focus on reviewing your English.

644
00:30:34,350 --> 00:30:34,750
You...

645
00:30:35,130 --> 00:30:35,850
Cao Xin,

646
00:30:36,120 --> 00:30:37,820
you actually watch TV dramas?

647
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,400
I watch with someone.

648
00:30:39,640 --> 00:30:40,110
Pardon?

649
00:30:41,310 --> 00:30:41,920
With who?

650
00:30:42,270 --> 00:30:44,440
W-Watch with his sister, of course.

651
00:30:45,110 --> 00:30:45,920
Just ignore him.

652
00:30:45,920 --> 00:30:46,920
He knows nothing.

653
00:30:49,640 --> 00:30:51,300
You know what? The female lead

654
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:52,640
may be goofy and cute,

655
00:30:52,960 --> 00:30:53,750
but I find

656
00:30:53,770 --> 00:30:55,700
that side of her really unlikable.

657
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:56,640
Why?

658
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:58,350
She wants to do a good job, obviously,

659
00:30:58,350 --> 00:31:00,110
but she's always scatterbrained,

660
00:31:00,110 --> 00:31:01,770
clumsy, and making mistakes.

661
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:03,590
Having a coworker like her would be

662
00:31:03,590 --> 00:31:04,480
a nightmare.

663
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:06,020
She should at least

664
00:31:06,020 --> 00:31:07,070
hone her skills first

665
00:31:07,070 --> 00:31:08,600
before talking about love.

666
00:31:10,210 --> 00:31:11,070
But she'll have

667
00:31:11,070 --> 00:31:12,920
the male lead's protection in the future.

668
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,720
Isn't it nice to find a safe haven

669
00:31:14,830 --> 00:31:16,000
through love?

670
00:31:16,110 --> 00:31:18,030
Relying on others is nowhere near
as good as relying on yourself.

671
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:19,410
You'll never grow up
if you only rely on others.

672
00:31:19,410 --> 00:31:21,160
What others give you,
no matter how good, is still theirs.

673
00:31:21,160 --> 00:31:22,690
Only what you earn on your own

674
00:31:22,690 --> 00:31:23,830
truly belongs to you,

675
00:31:23,830 --> 00:31:25,290
and no one can take it away.

676
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:29,350
I think

677
00:31:29,350 --> 00:31:30,310
what you just said

678
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:32,710
is pretty much
what a female lead would say.

679
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:36,240
I'd rather just be myself.

680
00:31:36,510 --> 00:31:37,910
I don't dare to dream big.

681
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:38,750
Why?

682
00:31:38,830 --> 00:31:39,400
Qi Shi,

683
00:31:39,600 --> 00:31:40,680
you're the most like

684
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:41,790
a female lead

685
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:43,820
out of everyone I've ever met.

686
00:31:46,350 --> 00:31:46,920
You're

687
00:31:47,580 --> 00:31:48,620
honest, brave,

688
00:31:49,790 --> 00:31:51,060
hardworking, and kind.

689
00:31:51,060 --> 00:31:53,320
You also always rank first in every exam.

690
00:31:53,510 --> 00:31:54,160
You're also very...

691
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:54,720
But

692
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:55,890
what female lead

693
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:57,480
has bad eyesight, poor stamina,

694
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:59,270
and even wears a wig every day?

695
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:05,640
I'll let you be the first to enjoy

696
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:06,640
my new comic book.

697
00:32:13,930 --> 00:32:14,700
Try this.

698
00:32:15,160 --> 00:32:16,090
It's delicious.

699
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:22,110
Come and take a look.

700
00:32:23,310 --> 00:32:25,570
Steel wire, wooden buckets, rat poison!

701
00:32:27,110 --> 00:32:29,640
Toothpaste, toothbrushes,
old-fashioned soap!

702
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:30,500
Want anything?

703
00:32:32,880 --> 00:32:34,200
Come and take a look.

704
00:32:37,240 --> 00:32:38,100
Want anything?

705
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:41,010
How much is this now?

706
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:43,330
Steel wire, wooden buckets, rat poison!

707
00:32:44,240 --> 00:32:45,300
Is it still 80 yuan?

708
00:32:46,070 --> 00:32:47,440
Come and take a look.

709
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:49,510
Toothpaste, toothbrushes,
old-fashioned soap.

710
00:32:49,510 --> 00:32:51,570
The newly built toilet is so far away.

711
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:53,930
How much is this?

712
00:32:56,550 --> 00:32:57,750
Is this still 80 yuan?

713
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:59,380
Our stuff sells well. It's

714
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:00,450
not for sale.

715
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:02,350
This is a mascot.

716
00:33:11,330 --> 00:33:12,030
Cao Dongfang

717
00:33:12,030 --> 00:33:13,490
bought all of them before.

718
00:33:14,110 --> 00:33:15,510
Who else would want this stuff

719
00:33:15,510 --> 00:33:16,370
other than him?

720
00:33:19,790 --> 00:33:20,650
Come back here.

721
00:33:22,200 --> 00:33:24,270
Last deal of the day—you get a bargain.

722
00:33:24,270 --> 00:33:24,800
100 yuan.

723
00:33:26,110 --> 00:33:27,140
The tomatoes...

724
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:27,900
I want 500 grams.

725
00:33:27,900 --> 00:33:28,310
Okay.

726
00:33:34,070 --> 00:33:34,680
This isn't

727
00:33:34,680 --> 00:33:36,080
the same batch as before.

728
00:33:36,590 --> 00:33:38,390
This is made of Hainan rosewood.

729
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:43,330
Okay.

730
00:33:45,020 --> 00:33:46,620
I'll take some carrots, too.

731
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:55,160
Here, take a look.

732
00:33:55,390 --> 00:33:56,650
-Good
-They're fresh.

733
00:34:01,830 --> 00:34:03,090
Look how happy you are.

734
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:09,360
Feels so good.

735
00:34:24,150 --> 00:34:26,409
Nothing feels better than making money.

736
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:29,380
You think Cao Dongfang

737
00:34:29,380 --> 00:34:30,190
has no idea?

738
00:34:30,510 --> 00:34:31,440
He's not stupid.

739
00:34:32,280 --> 00:34:33,670
He knew you were ripping him off.

740
00:34:33,670 --> 00:34:34,600
He did it on purpose.

741
00:34:34,600 --> 00:34:35,810
I don't care,

742
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:37,230
as long as I make money!

743
00:34:40,230 --> 00:34:41,070
Sometimes,

744
00:34:44,929 --> 00:34:46,060
I think Cao Dongfang

745
00:34:46,070 --> 00:34:46,800
isn't so bad.

746
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:48,440
Look,

747
00:34:48,750 --> 00:34:49,550
we've been giving him

748
00:34:49,550 --> 00:34:51,110
the cold shoulder all these years,

749
00:34:51,110 --> 00:34:53,310
but he's still supported our business.

750
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,850
He also treats Cao Xin well.

751
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,330
I heard he bought Cao Xin

752
00:34:57,670 --> 00:34:58,840
a computer.

753
00:34:59,290 --> 00:35:00,590
It's said to be the latest,

754
00:35:00,590 --> 00:35:01,510
top-of-the-line one,

755
00:35:01,510 --> 00:35:02,510
quite expensive.

756
00:35:03,040 --> 00:35:04,070
That's because he feels guilty

757
00:35:04,070 --> 00:35:05,470
and knows he did us wrong.

758
00:35:07,710 --> 00:35:09,070
He knows he owes us for what he did

759
00:35:09,070 --> 00:35:09,730
in the past.

760
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:11,660
He just wants to make up for it.

761
00:35:12,850 --> 00:35:13,920
J-Just this little money

762
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:14,920
can make up for it?

763
00:35:15,600 --> 00:35:16,150
You know what?

764
00:35:16,150 --> 00:35:17,110
Next time I'll stock up

765
00:35:17,110 --> 00:35:18,020
on more ornaments.

766
00:35:18,020 --> 00:35:18,620
I'll order

767
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:20,800
those heavy, bulky, and ugly ones.

768
00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:22,880
I'll still sell them to him next time.

769
00:35:22,880 --> 00:35:25,010
And I'll make
a 40-yuan profit off him.

770
00:35:26,930 --> 00:35:28,400
What are we having for dinner?

771
00:35:28,400 --> 00:35:29,060
Leftovers.

772
00:35:34,510 --> 00:35:35,920
The school will hold a gala

773
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:37,840
to celebrate New Year's Day.

774
00:35:38,360 --> 00:35:39,450
Performers will be

775
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:41,400
selected from all sophomores

776
00:35:41,700 --> 00:35:43,320
for the English play,

777
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:45,120
"The Story of the Flower Fairy."

778
00:35:45,170 --> 00:35:47,360
Hope everyone seizes this last chance

779
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:48,670
in high school

780
00:35:48,690 --> 00:35:49,810
to show your talents

781
00:35:49,810 --> 00:35:51,010
and sign up actively.

782
00:35:52,800 --> 00:35:53,400
Sign me up.

783
00:35:57,030 --> 00:35:58,190
What role are you signing up for?

784
00:35:58,190 --> 00:36:00,320
With my looks and aura,

785
00:36:00,800 --> 00:36:02,060
the prince, of course.

786
00:36:02,070 --> 00:36:03,360
But I'm open to anything.

787
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:05,550
It's all about participating actively.

788
00:36:05,550 --> 00:36:06,410
As for the role,

789
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:08,410
I'll take whatever they assign me.

790
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:19,720
Are you interested, too?

791
00:36:21,360 --> 00:36:22,140
Not at all.

792
00:36:22,400 --> 00:36:23,530
I'm just passing by.

793
00:36:25,070 --> 00:36:26,530
She's never being honest.

794
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:29,480
A line from a TV drama.

795
00:36:36,630 --> 00:36:37,070
Dad.

796
00:36:37,740 --> 00:36:39,190
Why are you putting away my quilt?

797
00:36:39,190 --> 00:36:40,220
Perfect timing. Come

798
00:36:40,220 --> 00:36:41,220
and give me a hand.

799
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:42,480
What for?

800
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:44,080
We're having a guest.

801
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:46,280
Is Grandma back again?

802
00:36:46,510 --> 00:36:48,570
It's not your grandma, but your aunt.

803
00:36:48,630 --> 00:36:49,960
I have an aunt?

804
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:51,890
A cousin of mine.

805
00:36:52,230 --> 00:36:52,850
So,

806
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:54,800
she'll be staying here for a while.

807
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:57,190
You'll make do
with the top bunk for a few days.

808
00:36:57,190 --> 00:36:57,960
Mom, Mom!

809
00:36:59,040 --> 00:36:59,770
Mom, well...

810
00:37:00,150 --> 00:37:01,920
Is it really necessary to make such a fuss

811
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:04,030
over an aunt of mine
we haven't seen in ages?

812
00:37:04,030 --> 00:37:05,630
She lives abroad

813
00:37:05,660 --> 00:37:06,920
and rarely comes back.

814
00:37:07,110 --> 00:37:08,670
We have to show proper courtesy

815
00:37:08,670 --> 00:37:10,200
and give her a warm welcome.

816
00:37:10,480 --> 00:37:11,010
Since...

817
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,230
Since when do you two

818
00:37:12,230 --> 00:37:13,430
care about courtesy?

819
00:37:17,900 --> 00:37:19,560
I heard from your grandma that

820
00:37:19,710 --> 00:37:21,730
every time your aunt comes back,

821
00:37:21,760 --> 00:37:23,090
she brings everyone...

822
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:25,920
This.

823
00:37:28,070 --> 00:37:28,590
This?

824
00:37:28,590 --> 00:37:29,160
Yeah,

825
00:37:29,190 --> 00:37:31,300
she'll definitely bring some this time.

826
00:37:31,300 --> 00:37:32,690
Courtesy costs nothing, then.

827
00:37:32,690 --> 00:37:34,420
We must give her a warm welcome.

828
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:37,000
Excuse me,

829
00:37:37,020 --> 00:37:38,460
is this Aihua's house?

830
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:40,540
Speak of the devil.

831
00:37:40,860 --> 00:37:41,320
There

832
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:41,920
she comes.

833
00:37:42,070 --> 00:37:42,530
Really?

834
00:37:43,150 --> 00:37:43,710
Here!

835
00:37:44,250 --> 00:37:45,000
We're over here!

836
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:45,510
Come on.

837
00:37:46,400 --> 00:37:47,000
Over here.

838
00:37:47,480 --> 00:37:48,000
Aihua?

839
00:37:50,230 --> 00:37:50,760
Xiaofei,

840
00:37:51,550 --> 00:37:52,930
after all these years, you haven't

841
00:37:52,930 --> 00:37:53,440
changed at all.

842
00:37:53,440 --> 00:37:54,130
You still look

843
00:37:54,130 --> 00:37:55,260
so young and pretty.

844
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:56,620
This is my wife.

845
00:37:56,770 --> 00:37:57,850
Hello, Xiaofei.

846
00:37:57,880 --> 00:37:58,400
Nice to meet you.

847
00:37:58,400 --> 00:37:59,330
Nice to meet you.

848
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:00,660
Come say hi.

849
00:38:00,880 --> 00:38:01,920
Say hi, come on.

850
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:02,480
C...

851
00:38:03,480 --> 00:38:03,960
Cousin?

852
00:38:04,680 --> 00:38:06,040
Oh, kid. What cousin?

853
00:38:06,070 --> 00:38:06,980
She's your aunt.

854
00:38:06,980 --> 00:38:07,780
Call her aunt.

855
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:09,070
Aunt.

856
00:38:09,670 --> 00:38:10,470
Qi Shi?

857
00:38:11,130 --> 00:38:12,280
You've grown so much!

858
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:12,840
Yeah.

859
00:38:14,110 --> 00:38:14,570
Come on,

860
00:38:14,800 --> 00:38:16,230
let's go inside. Come on in.

861
00:38:16,230 --> 00:38:16,510
You must be tired.

862
00:38:16,510 --> 00:38:17,110
Come on in.

863
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:19,070
Was the trip tiring?

864
00:38:19,070 --> 00:38:19,730
It was okay.

865
00:38:22,120 --> 00:38:23,190
Our place is a bit humble.

866
00:38:23,190 --> 00:38:24,320
Hope you don't mind.

867
00:38:24,960 --> 00:38:26,030
It's pretty nice.

868
00:38:26,750 --> 00:38:28,150
What's the saying again?

869
00:38:28,630 --> 00:38:29,830
"It feels like home."

870
00:38:30,890 --> 00:38:32,190
You'll stay in this room.

871
00:38:32,190 --> 00:38:33,480
Qi Shi gets the top bunk,

872
00:38:33,480 --> 00:38:34,740
and you get the bottom.

873
00:38:34,890 --> 00:38:36,040
Hope you don't mind.

874
00:38:36,070 --> 00:38:37,330
I'm very happy with it.

875
00:38:39,180 --> 00:38:40,510
Coming from so far away,

876
00:38:40,920 --> 00:38:42,380
I don't know what you need,

877
00:38:43,090 --> 00:38:44,750
so this is the most practical.

878
00:38:47,040 --> 00:38:48,280
You're just visiting my place

879
00:38:48,280 --> 00:38:49,250
and having fun for a few days.

880
00:38:49,250 --> 00:38:50,480
You're being too polite.

881
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:51,010
Exactly.

882
00:38:51,190 --> 00:38:51,960
You can't just hand over

883
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:53,230
a big red envelope right away.

884
00:38:53,230 --> 00:38:53,800
No, no way,

885
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:55,470
you're b-being way too polite.

886
00:38:55,470 --> 00:38:56,400
Really, this...

887
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,440
This won't do.

888
00:38:58,510 --> 00:38:59,440
It's for the kid.

889
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:01,230
Take it.

890
00:39:05,630 --> 00:39:07,360
It's our first time meeting today.

891
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:08,050
Consider this

892
00:39:08,050 --> 00:39:09,550
making up for the New Year's red envelopes

893
00:39:09,550 --> 00:39:10,480
all these years.

894
00:39:14,070 --> 00:39:15,070
I'll take it then.

895
00:39:16,240 --> 00:39:17,040
Oh, girl...

896
00:39:17,070 --> 00:39:17,400
Yeah.

897
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:18,030
Why didn't you

898
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:19,670
show some manners to your aunt?

899
00:39:19,670 --> 00:39:21,000
This kid has no manners at all.

900
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:21,550
Yeah.

901
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:22,190
Well,

902
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:24,530
then, I'll use this to pay her tuition.

903
00:39:24,590 --> 00:39:25,920
Come on, say thank you to your aunt.

904
00:39:25,920 --> 00:39:27,250
Quickly, say thank you.

905
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,060
Thank you, Auntie.

906
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:30,510
Hurry up and cook.

907
00:39:30,510 --> 00:39:31,960
Oh, right. Let's go cook.

908
00:39:32,670 --> 00:39:33,630
Your hair...

909
00:39:35,590 --> 00:39:36,390
It's nothing.

910
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:38,770
There was a little flying bug
in your hair.

911
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:41,360
I could just brush it off.

912
00:39:42,550 --> 00:39:43,230
Qi Shi,

913
00:39:43,910 --> 00:39:44,970
I plan to go

914
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:46,440
to the mall nearby later.

915
00:39:46,710 --> 00:39:47,440
You come with me?

916
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:48,030
Sure.

917
00:39:48,880 --> 00:39:51,080
I'd like to buy some daily necessities.

918
00:39:52,550 --> 00:39:53,680
Daily necessities?

919
00:39:53,760 --> 00:39:54,090
Well,

920
00:39:54,590 --> 00:39:55,670
we just sell

921
00:39:55,670 --> 00:39:56,360
daily necessities.

922
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:57,030
We have plenty of them.

923
00:39:57,030 --> 00:39:57,480
Yeah.

924
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:58,800
Where are your manners?

925
00:39:58,800 --> 00:39:59,480
Do you think my auntie

926
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:00,530
could use a 2-yuan soap?

927
00:40:00,530 --> 00:40:01,260
She deserves

928
00:40:01,480 --> 00:40:02,740
at least a 40-yuan one.

929
00:40:03,440 --> 00:40:03,900
Auntie,

930
00:40:04,070 --> 00:40:05,330
I'm taking you there right now.

931
00:40:05,330 --> 00:40:06,930
Then make it quick.

932
00:40:06,960 --> 00:40:08,070
Come home for dinner.

933
00:40:08,070 --> 00:40:08,550
Okay.

934
00:40:09,280 --> 00:40:10,090
We're heading out.

935
00:40:10,090 --> 00:40:10,550
Okay.

936
00:40:18,110 --> 00:40:18,960
Welcome.

937
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:20,840
Look,

938
00:40:21,150 --> 00:40:21,920
little vixen.

939
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:22,880
Wearing such a short skirt,

940
00:40:22,880 --> 00:40:24,110
isn't she afraid of being laughed at?

941
00:40:24,110 --> 00:40:25,530
And with sunglasses at night,

942
00:40:25,530 --> 00:40:26,280
what a show-off.

943
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:27,810
Exactly, how pretentious.

944
00:40:31,320 --> 00:40:32,120
What's wrong?

945
00:40:34,670 --> 00:40:35,150
Well,

946
00:40:35,550 --> 00:40:36,190
Auntie,

947
00:40:36,880 --> 00:40:37,320
I...

948
00:40:38,360 --> 00:40:39,630
I really admire you.

949
00:40:40,240 --> 00:40:41,230
How can you turn a deaf ear

950
00:40:41,230 --> 00:40:42,290
to all this gossip?

951
00:40:45,030 --> 00:40:45,960
"Little vixen"?

952
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:50,080
You think they're insulting me?

953
00:40:50,670 --> 00:40:51,500
I actually think

954
00:40:51,500 --> 00:40:52,700
they're praising me.

955
00:40:54,080 --> 00:40:54,850
Who sets

956
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:55,780
the standard for

957
00:40:55,780 --> 00:40:56,510
what clothes to wear

958
00:40:56,510 --> 00:40:57,710
or what lipstick to put on

959
00:40:57,710 --> 00:40:58,920
at a certain age?

960
00:40:59,400 --> 00:41:00,230
Besides,

961
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:01,480
who gets to define

962
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:03,380
what's beautiful?

963
00:41:04,760 --> 00:41:06,030
I'm almost 40,

964
00:41:06,510 --> 00:41:08,550
and they still call me a little vixen.

965
00:41:08,550 --> 00:41:10,000
It proves I'm pretty.

966
00:41:11,520 --> 00:41:12,360
Anyway, I think

967
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:12,900
I'm the most

968
00:41:12,900 --> 00:41:14,300
beautiful woman in the world.

969
00:41:14,300 --> 00:41:15,400
Even when I get older,

970
00:41:15,400 --> 00:41:16,920
I'll keep being a little vixen.

971
00:41:16,920 --> 00:41:17,950
It's my life,

972
00:41:18,190 --> 00:41:19,320
and I call the shots.

973
00:41:21,970 --> 00:41:23,000
Do you want to see

974
00:41:23,030 --> 00:41:25,430
how a little minx
turns into a little fairy?

975
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:33,280
Are you the manager?

976
00:41:33,930 --> 00:41:34,480
Yes, I am.

977
00:41:36,440 --> 00:41:37,050
I want to place an order.

978
00:41:37,050 --> 00:41:40,290
[Chairman Qi Xiaofei]

979
00:41:38,030 --> 00:41:40,760
Xiaofei Huanyu, Qi Xiaofei,

980
00:41:41,430 --> 00:41:42,760
-Chairman?
-Chairman?

981
00:41:45,150 --> 00:41:47,280
-Hello, Chairman.
-Hello, Chairman.

982
00:41:48,320 --> 00:41:48,960
We have

983
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:50,840
plenty of high-quality suppliers here.

984
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:52,800
Fast delivery,
guaranteed quality and quantity,

985
00:41:52,800 --> 00:41:53,920
and discounts for bulk orders.

986
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:54,880
Feel free to contact me

987
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:56,140
if you need any of them.

988
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:57,840
This is my business card.

989
00:42:00,590 --> 00:42:01,720
Wait for my message.

990
00:42:14,510 --> 00:42:15,710
Take care, Chairman.

991
00:42:19,440 --> 00:42:20,710
Would you like me
to arrange a car for you?

992
00:42:20,710 --> 00:42:21,310
Take care.

993
00:42:21,630 --> 00:42:22,030
See?

994
00:42:22,130 --> 00:42:23,250
Who dares to call me

995
00:42:23,280 --> 00:42:24,340
a little vixen now?

996
00:42:25,000 --> 00:42:25,590
Auntie,

997
00:42:27,250 --> 00:42:28,980
you're so cool.

998
00:42:31,070 --> 00:42:33,120
This is an ever-changing world,

999
00:42:33,150 --> 00:42:34,800
with everyone being different.

1000
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:36,230
So there's no single standard

1001
00:42:36,230 --> 00:42:37,440
to judge everything.

1002
00:42:37,710 --> 00:42:38,550
Don't let

1003
00:42:38,550 --> 00:42:40,280
this kind of gossip bother you.

1004
00:42:40,630 --> 00:42:42,150
You are the only one who decides

1005
00:42:42,150 --> 00:42:43,350
if you are beautiful.

1006
00:42:44,510 --> 00:42:45,370
Remember this—

1007
00:42:45,630 --> 00:42:46,290
from now on,

1008
00:42:46,630 --> 00:42:47,630
no matter what you do,

1009
00:42:47,630 --> 00:42:49,110
you must do it out of

1010
00:42:49,110 --> 00:42:49,590
true love

1011
00:42:49,590 --> 00:42:50,320
and passion.

1012
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:53,300
As long as you have
the courage and strength,

1013
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:54,280
no one in this world

1014
00:42:54,280 --> 00:42:55,480
will look down on you.

1015
00:42:58,760 --> 00:42:59,190
Let's go.
